/* Prototype hard reset. The shared theme stylesheet constrains ordinary
 * `main` elements for the legacy feed layout. These page roots must escape
 * that constraint or the prototypes collapse into a narrow centered column.
 * The prototypes specify px, so the primary geometry deliberately uses px. */
/* ===== Homepage top nav: centered, sticky bar (番茄小说网 prototype) =====
 * The `.fq-*` classes are only styled here (no shared base), so every property
 * is spelled out. `!important` is kept on the geometry so the shared theme's
 * generic `header`/`nav` resets cannot collapse this bar. */

/* The shared stylesheet centers the whole document in a 70ch reading column
 * (`html { max-width: 70ch; margin: auto; padding: 1.5em 0.2em }`). That is
 * right for the legacy single-column feed, but it collapses the novel
